ues-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yE6aDcbbK8pmvNroXnQYQA","review_id":"44Wyvg3umXSknaUpoK5AZQ","date":"2019-04-03T22:54:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9314848184585571,"text_excerpt":"Lunch here, while still good, dulls in comparison to breakfast, which was out of this world! Service was great - line for lunch was out the door and they got us moved through quickly. Staff behind the counter is sassy and we loved every second of it. Went with a ribs special, which cones with a side of shrimp fried rice but we opted to swap out for a side of fries (bc ew). Everything on the plate was amazing - rib meat fell off the bones and was covered in the most delicious BBQ sauce. Also got an order of red beans and rice which was great and SO MUCH food. All for $7. Definitely recommend this spot if you're looking for somewhere to eat in the city that's frequented by locals but go for..."},{"business_id":"yE6aDcbbK8pmvNroXnQYQA","review_id":"A_zmU5U3FaUozXwW-HH69w","date":"2015-01-05T00:03:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9294230937957764,"text_excerpt":"There are two places in NOLA that are local and have amazing food and service. This is DEFINITELY one of them. I just saw a review that said \"Get it together you bunch of rude mean people.\" I don't know the reviewer, but I cannot even imagine that person has a clue of what he/she is talking about. The staff was absolutely INCREDIBLE. They were soooo nice and helpful, guiding us on what to have, being patient when we couldn't decide, and showing approval for my boyfriend's insane appetite for incredible food. It's really just a down to earth local place to enjoy good cajun food or a simple, diner breakfast. It is cash only, so make sure you come prepared."},{"business_id":"yE6aDcbbK8pmvNroXnQYQA","review_id":"DEKgClAx2MtfX_QmCHdy_w","date":"2017-03-10T00:05:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9293036460876465,"text_excerpt":"Love this place. The service and staff are unreal. Little comfy spot with good food and people. Good food for prices you would pay at a fast food joint. Friends ordered a few different dishes but two of us ended up ordering the CBB - after a few, or quite a few drinks the night before this brought me back to life. Sausage, cheese sauce and jalapeños over a biscuit with an egg on top. The half order was plenty of food. Very very very good. Our server was awesome. Didn't catch her name but she was great. Looking forward to headed back here for breakfast as soon as I'm back in town! Love it."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yE6aDcbbK8pmvNroXnQYQA","photo_id":"1shmja_FzFjuEEGtWjfbfg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/1shmja_FzFjuEEGtWjfbfg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8346947431564331},{"business_id":"yE6aDcbbK8pmvNroXnQYQA","photo_id":"_qJN0z7FqsEGjiL2ZkVS2w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_qJN0z7FqsEGjiL2ZkVS2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8170751929283142},{"business_id":"yE6aDcbbK8pmvNroXnQYQA","photo_id":"Qo7-JxucSS8XPJ-bFiR3HQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Qo7-JxucSS8XPJ-bFiR3HQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8127197027206421},{"business_id":"yE6aDcbbK8pmvNroXnQYQA","photo_id":"gAjXWcRaUHC51y4FRQaOSw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos